141208,PAA-2000SI,agapito,Paasche 2000SI Airbrush Kit,Paasche 2000SI Airbrush Kit,1.200,89,0,,"<span style=""font-weight: bold;"">Features:</span><br /> <EOL> <EOL> <EOL>The SI airbrush is single action but also internal mix which keeps operation simple but allows for better detail than external mix models. Included with the airbrush is the size three spray head, which allow the SI airbrush to be used in a wide range of application.  <EOL> <EOL>The SI single action allows the user to achieve fine lines down to 1/32 inch and wider patterns of up to 1-1/2 inches. . <br /> <EOL> <EOL><br /> <EOL> <EOL>The best uses are those requiring more basic spraying like solid coats, uniform lines or stencil work. Clean up is as simple as spraying your paint cleaner though the airbrush. The SI is used for many applications including hobby, craft, chip and ding repair, taxidermy, ceramics, cake decorating, tanning, tattoos, etc.  <EOL> <EOL><br /> <EOL> <EOL><br /> <EOL> <EOL>The SI airbrush is made in the US and includes the following:  <EOL><br /> <EOL> <EOL><ul> <EOL>	<li> <EOL>SI#3 airbrush <EOL></li> <EOL>	<li>1/4oz metal cup <EOL></li> <EOL>	<li>1oz bottle assembly <EOL></li> <EOL>	<li>1oz storage bottle <EOL>hanger</li> <EOL>	<li>wrench <EOL>6' </li> <EOL>	<li>hose <EOL>lessons booklet and manual</li> <EOL></ul> <EOL> <EOL> <EOL><ul> <EOL>	 <EOL>	 <EOL>	 <EOL>	 <EOL>	 <EOL> <EOL></ul>",,10000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,10,Y,362,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Single Action: Internal Mix,,57.630,,Monday 16 July 2012 11:05:29 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614147559,44.500,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
