16619,PAA-AUFB,master,Paasche AUFB Spray Gun,Paasche AUFB Spray Gun,1.380,99,0,,"<B>The AUFB or AUTF spray guns are for painting and finishing larger areas not attainable with an artist airbrush.</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>ANF Multipleheads, available in six sizes, can spray a narrow to broad pattern depending on which size is used. AR Multipleheads can produce a round pattern for line, detail, and stencil work. These Spray Guns have 1/4"" fluid and air inlets. They require a minimum of 0.25 to 3 cfm. at 30 psi. pressure, depending upon viscosity of fluid and size of Multiplehead. Fluid containers must be purchased separately.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Components:<br> <EOL>*AUFB (gun only)<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 1 lb. 6 oz. (623 g.)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Requires a minimum of 0.25 to 3 cfm. @ 30 psi. pressure depending upon viscosity of fluid and size of Multiplehead.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><I>*Bottle shown in picture is not included.</I> <EOL>",,0,9,N,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,401,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Single Action: Internal Mix/Spray Guns,,89,,Thursday 17 May 2007 10:31:55 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,,69.300,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
