16639,PAA-DTA-SET,master,Paasche DTA-SET Tanning Set with Case,Paasche DTA-SET Tanning Set with Case,1.500,87,0,,"<B>The HS single-action airbrush provides a smooth and easy airbrush tan.</B><br> <EOL>The set comes complete with two bottle assemblies, 10' air hose and a travel/storage case. The HS airbrush can be used with Leisure Tan® tanning solution.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>DTA-SET components:<br> <EOL>* HS#3 Single-Action Airbrush<br> <EOL>* HPS-3-OZ Color Bottle Assembly (3oz/89cc)<br> <EOL>* Storage Storage Bottle w/Cap (3oz/89cc)<br> <EOL>* A-1/8-10 10' Air Hose w/Couplings<br> <EOL>* A-34 Hanger<br> <EOL>* F-186 & V-62 Wrenches<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 1 lb. 8 oz. (681 g.)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Recommended air pressure is 0.5 to 1 cfm. @ 20 to 45 lbs. depending on tip size and fluid being sprayed. Clean, dry air is essential for best results.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Compressor recommendations: Salon use - D3000; Home use - D500S or D3000. <EOL>",,0,1,N,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,2345,Discontinued Products,,67.090,,Friday 18 May 2007 10:43:53 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,,60.900,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
