16579,PAA-MIL-3W,master,Paasche Millennium Airbrush Set with Deluxe Wood Carrying Case,Paasche Millennium Airbrush Set with Deluxe Wood Carrying Case,1.880,149,0,,"<B>Millennium airbrush features a thin barrel grip and a cut-away red anodized handle that allows quick pullback of needle mechanism to blow out clogs.</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Round trigger button rolls under your finger for greater comfort and better control. Uses the same pressure and volume air requirements as the VL airbrush. The VL-WOOD comes with all three sizes – 1, 3 & 5.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>MIL-WOOD components:<br> <EOL>* MIL#3 Double-Action Airbrush<br> <EOL>* VL-1-OZ Color Bottle Assembly (1oz/29cc)<br> <EOL>* H-194 1oz. Bottle, Cap/Gasket (1oz/29cc)<br> <EOL>* VL-1/4-OZ Metal Color Cup (1/4oz/7cc)<br> <EOL>* A-1/8-6 6' Air Hose w/AC-20 & AC-1/8<br> <EOL>* TTALB “22 Airbrush Lessons” Booklet<br> <EOL>* VLT-1 and VLT-5 Tips<br> <EOL>* VLN-1 and VLN-5 Needles<br> <EOL>* VLA-1 and VLA-5 Aircaps<br> <EOL>* A-34 Hanger<br> <EOL>* V-62 Wrench<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 2 lbs. 6 oz. (1.08 kg.)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Tip opening sizes (included):<br> <EOL>Size #1 light fluids-spray pattern 1/64""- 1"" (0.55 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL>Size #3 medium fluids-spray pattern 1/32""- 1 1/4"" (0.73 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL>Size #5 heavy fluids-spray pattern 1/16""- 1 1/2"" (1.07 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Recommended air pressure 0.5 to 1 cfm. @ 20 to 45 psi., depending on tip size and fluid being sprayed. Clean, dry air is essential for best results.",,9983,16,Y,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,54277,Airbrushing/Airbrush Compressors and Accessories,,95.680,,Monday 14 May 2007 10:03:57 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614132241,74.500,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
