16568,PAA-AECR,master,Paasche Model AECR Remote Feed Air Eraser,Paasche Model AECR Remote Feed Air Eraser,2.500,138,0,,"<B>The AECR reproduces all the fine accomplishments of the AEC air eraser and with its quart cup offers greater flexibility through use of a remote quart container.</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>This eraser offers a greater freedom of movement for the operator. The optional R-75AR regulator with gauge and moisture drain gives user closer control of operating pressures as well as assisting in furnishing clean, dry, regulated air. Always wear protective equipment - glasses and respirator - when using this air eraser.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>AECR components:</b><br> <EOL>* AECR remote feed air eraser<br> <EOL>* 20SCC quart cup 32 oz. (946 ml.)<br> <EOL>* AE-51 cover assembly<br> <EOL>* AE-52 plastic hose assembly<br> <EOL>* AE-59 gasket<br> <EOL>* A-1/8"": 6' air hose with model MT moisture trap<br> <EOL>* 7-GN gasket and parts list.<br> <EOL>* Parts List <EOL>Shipping weight: 2 lbs. 6 oz. (1.077 kg.)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL><b>Optional accessories:</b><br>  <EOL>* R-75 regulator & filter with gauge (not included)<br> <EOL>* PBO-12 safety release valve<br> <EOL>* HF-592 adapter<br> <EOL>* HF-33 adapter<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Recommended air pressure: 20 to 65 psi. Clean, dry air is essential for best results. <EOL>",,9976,45,Y,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,374,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Accessories/Air Eraser Kits,,88.620,,Saturday 12 May 2007 06:40:28 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614000182,69,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
