16599,PAA-AP-H,master,Paasche Model AP-H Single Action Airbrush Paint Kit,Paasche Model AP-H Single Action Airbrush Paint Kit,1.250,93,0,,"<B>Suitable for virtually any airbrush work including fine detail.</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Perfect for the artist, craftsman, decorator and hobbyist. This kit includes three Paasche Extreme airbrush acrylic paints and one Extreme airbrush cleaner.<br> <EOL>The world's most popular airbrush - recommended for all skill levels. Sturdy and flexible, the H & HS airbrushes are dependable and adaptable for practically any hobby or artistic use. The model H has a tapered socket for securing a bottle or a cup.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL> <EOL>AP-H components:<br> <EOL>* H#3 Single-Action Airbrush<br> <EOL>* A-1/8-4 4' Air Hose w/Couplings<br> <EOL>* H-1-OZ Color Bottle Assembly (1oz/29cc)<br> <EOL>* 21H Paint Bottle Cover Assembly (3 each)<br> <EOL>* APC-1 Extreme Airbrush Cleaner 1 oz. Bottle (1 only)<br> <EOL>* AP - Acrylic Paint Extreme Acrylic Paints in 1 oz. Bottles (3 each)<br> <EOL>* F-186 Wrench<br> <EOL>* Parts List<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 1 lb. 4 oz. (567 g.)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Tip opening sizes (available separately):<br> <EOL>Size #1 light fluid-spray pattern 1/32""- 1"", (0.45 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL>Size #5 heavy fluid-spray pattern 1/16""- 1 1/2"", (1.07 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Recommended air pressure 0.5 to 1 cfm. @ 20 to 45 psi., depending on tip size and fluid being sprayed. Clean, dry air is essential for best results.",,0,1,N,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,370,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Single Action: External Mix/H Series: Siphon Feed,,48.480,,Tuesday 15 May 2007 05:03:52 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614139929,37.200,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
16565,PAA-AP-VL,master,Paasche Model AP-VL Double Action Airbrush Paint Kit,Paasche Model AP-VL Double Action Airbrush Paint Kit,1.250,118,0,,"<B>Suitable for virtually any airbrush work including fine detail. Perfect for the artist, craftsman, decorator and hobbyist.</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>This kit includes three Paasche Extreme Airbrush acrylic paints and one Extreme airbrush cleaner. No other airbrush can offer more versatility. Used by most of the t-shirt artists in the U.S., this model can achieve spray patterns from fine detail to broader coverage by handling light, medium and heavy fluids. Suitable for both left or right-handed users. The VL has a tapered socket for securing a bottle or a cup.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>AP-VL components:<br> <EOL>* VL#3 professional double action airbrush<br> <EOL>* A-1/8"": 4' air hose with couplings<br> <EOL>* VL-1-OZ color bottle assembly (29 cc.)<br> <EOL>* 21VL Paint Bottle Cover Assembly (3 each)<br> <EOL>* APC-1 Extreme airbrush cleaner 1 oz. bottle<br> <EOL>* AP - Acrylic Paint Extreme Acrylic Paints in 1 oz. Bottles (3 each)<br> <EOL>* V-62 wrench<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 1 lb. 4 oz. (567 g.)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Tip opening sizes (sold separately):<br> <EOL>Size #1 light fluids-spray pattern 1/64""- 1"" (0.55 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL>Size #5 heavy fluids-spray pattern 1/16""- 1 1/2"" (1.07 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Recommended air pressure 0.5 to 1 cfm. @ 20 to 45 psi., depending on tip size and fluid being sprayed. Clean, dry air is essential for best results.",,0,4,N,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,364,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Double Action: Internal Mix/VL Series: Siphon Feed,,61.430,,Saturday 12 May 2007 06:30:24 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614139936,47.200,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
