16561,PAA-MVL#3,master,Paasche Model MVL Double Action Airbrush Set w/Vynil Case,Paasche Model MVL Double Action Airbrush Set w/Vynil Case,1.500,102,0,,"<B>The MVL airbrush sets are available with a durable, highly polished, chrome-plated brass handle.</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>They are packaged in an attractive vinyl case with a long-lasting hinge and protective foam insert. No other airbrush can offer more versatility. Used by most of the t-shirt artists in the U.S., this model can achieve spray patterns from fine detail to broader coverage while handling light, medium and heavy fluids. Suitable for both left or right-handed users. The MVL has a tapered socket for securing a bottle or a cup.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>MVL components:<br> <EOL>*MVL#3 double action airbrush<br> <EOL>Size #3 medium fluids-spray pattern 1/32""- 1 1/4"" (0.73 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL>*HVL-202 metal handle<br> <EOL>*A-1/8"": 6' air hose with couplings<br> <EOL>*Two model VLP: 3 oz. color bottle assemblies (89 cc.)<br> <EOL>*V-62 wrench<br> <EOL>*A-34 hanger<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 1 lb. 8 oz. (681 g.)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Tip opening sizes (sold separately):<br> <EOL>Size #1 light fluids-spray pattern 1/64""- 1"" (0.55 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL>Size #5 heavy fluids-spray pattern 1/16""- 1 1/2"" (1.07 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Recommended air pressure 0.5 to 1 cfm. @ 20 to 45 psi., depending on tip size and fluid being sprayed. Clean, dry air is essential for best results.",,0,4,N,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,2345,Discontinued Products,,77.670,,Saturday 12 May 2007 06:05:40 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,,71.400,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
16563,PAA-MVLS#3,master,Paasche Model MVLS Double Action Airbrush Set w/Vynil Case,Paasche Model MVLS Double Action Airbrush Set w/Vynil Case,1.500,104.500,0,,"<B>The MVLS airbrush set is available with a durable, highly polished, chrome-plated brass handle.</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>They are packaged in an attractive vinyl case with a long-lasting hinge and protective foam insert. No other airbrush can offer more versatility. Used by most of the t-shirt artists in the U.S., this model can achieve spray patterns from fine detail to broader coverage while handling light, medium and heavy fluids. Suitable for both left or right-handed users. The MVLS has a threaded swivel nut for extra secure attachment to bottle assemblies.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>MVLS components:<br> <EOL>*MVLS#3 double action airbrush<br> <EOL>Size #3 medium fluids-spray pattern 1/32""- 1 1/4"" (0.73 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL>*HVL-202 metal handle<br> <EOL>*A-1/8"": 6' air hose with couplings<br> <EOL>*Model VLPS: Two 3 oz. color bottle assemblies (89 cc.)<br> <EOL>*V-62 wrench<br> <EOL>*A-34 hanger<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 1 lb. 8 oz. (681 g.)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Tip opening sizes (sold separately):<br> <EOL>Size #1 light fluids-spray pattern 1/64""- 1"" (0.55 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL>Size #5 heavy fluids-spray pattern 1/16""- 1 1/2"" (1.07 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Recommended air pressure 0.5 to 1 cfm. @ 20 to 45 psi., depending on tip size and fluid being sprayed. Clean, dry air is essential for best results.",,0,2,N,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,2345,Discontinued Products,,79.550,,Saturday 12 May 2007 06:22:26 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,,73.150,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
16582,PAA-NK,master,Paasche Model NK Nailkit With Vynil Case,Paasche Model NK Nailkit With Vynil Case,1.750,109,0,,"<B>Great for coloring nails!</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>VJR airbrush is for the professional who needs a wider range of patterns than offered by the AB model. Perfect for the project that requires detailing, tinting and shading. The VJR with its color cup built into the top of the body, promotes quick and easy color changes and is suited for both left and right-handed users. It is well packaged in an attractive vinyl case with a long-lasting hinge and protective foam insert.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>NK Components: <EOL>* VJR#2 Gravity Feed with built-in cup (1/64oz/.5cc)<br> <EOL>* HP-1/8-6 6' Plastic Air Hose w/Couplings<br> <EOL>* V-62 Wrench<Br> <EOL>* A-34 Hanger<Br> <EOL>* TTALB “22 Airbrush Lessons” Booklet<br> <EOL>* STENCIL-1 Nail Design Stencil<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 1 lb. 8 oz. (681 g.)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*Recommended air pressure 0.5 cfm. @ 15 to 35 psi. Clean, dry air is essential for best results. <EOL>",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,367,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Double Action: Internal Mix/VSR & VJR Series: Gravity Feed,,70,,Monday 14 May 2007 12:12:42 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614122563,54.500,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
