16580,PAA-VSR90#1,master,Paasche Model VSR90#1 Gravity Feed Airbrush Set with Vynil Case,Paasche Model VSR90#1 Gravity Feed Airbrush Set with Vynil Case,1.900,124,0,,"<B>The unique 2 in 1 design allows for quick color change by including 2 different size color cups.</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>Cups attach to top of airbrush assembly and left or right swivel for an unobstructed view. Suited for both left or right handed user. Extra needle, aircap and tip are included to convert airbrush for heavier fluids and broader coverage. Great for graphics, illustration or nail airbrushing.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>The VSR90#1 airbrush set is available with a durable, highly polished, chrome-plated brass handle. It is packaged in an attractive vinyl case with a long-lasting hinge and protective foam insert.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>VSR90 Components:<br> <EOL>* VSR90#1 Double-Action Gravity Feed Airbrush<br> <EOL>* A-1/8- 6 6' Air Hose w/Couplings<Br> <EOL>* VSR-2 Large Color Cup-3/16 oz. (3/16oz/5.25cc)<br> <EOL>* A-34 and V-62 Hanger and Wrench<br> <EOL>* VN-2, VT-2 and VA-2 Needle, Tip and Aircap to convert to size #2.<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 1lb. 8 oz. (681 g.)<br><br> <EOL>Tip opening sizes (included):<br> <EOL>Size #1 spray pattern - hairline - 1"", for light fluid (0.25 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL>Size #2 spray pattern 1/32"" - 1"", for medium fluid (0.66 mm. tip opening)<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>* Recommended air pressure 0.5 to 1 cfm. @ 15 to 35 psi. Clean, dry air is essential for best results. <EOL>",,0,29,N,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,2345,Discontinued Products,,79.300,,Monday 14 May 2007 10:19:54 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,,86.800,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
