141329,PAA-TS#3L,agapito,Paasche TS#3L Double Action Siphon Feed Airbrush Less Accessories,Paasche TS#3L Double Action Siphon Feed Airbrush Less Accessories ,0.390,92,0,,"<span style=""font-weight: bold;"">Features:</span><br /> <EOL>The airbrush features a chrome plated body and aluminum anodized cutaway <EOL> handle.  Included with the airbrush are all three available spray  <EOL>heads, which allow the TS to be used for most any application.  <br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL>The TS  <EOL>has the size 3 head which can achieve detail down to 1/32 inch and using <EOL> our optional fan head wider patterns up to 3 inches.  A PTFE packing  <EOL>enables the TS to handle any water or solvent based paint.  Clean up is  <EOL>as simple as spraying your paint cleaner though the airbrush and wiping  <EOL>of the needle.  <br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL>The TS can be used for many applications including<br /> <EOL> <EOL><ul> <EOL>	<li>hobby</li> <EOL>	<li>craft</li> <EOL>	<li>automotive</li> <EOL>	<li>t-shirts</li> <EOL>	<li>taxidermy</li> <EOL>	<li>ceramics</li> <EOL>	<li>cake  <EOL>decorating</li> <EOL>	<li>tanning</li> <EOL>	<li>tattoos, etc.  </li> <EOL></ul>The TS airbrush is made in the US  <EOL>and includes the following:<br /> <EOL> <EOL><ul> <EOL>	<li>TS#3 airbrush only and </li> <EOL>	<li>Manual.</li> <EOL></ul> <EOL>",,10000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,10,Y,361,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Double Action: Internal Mix,,59.570,,Tuesday 17 July 2012 09:33:09 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614147542,46,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
