16723,PAA-VIDEO-1,master,Paasche VL Airbrush Video (VCR),Paasche VL Airbrush Video (VCR),0.340,5,0,,"<B>This 30-minute video is designed to educate the beginning airbrush artist.</B><br> <EOL><br> <EOL>It is designed for the Paasche VL airbrush, but will also teach the user on airbrushing in general. This video covers differences between internal and external mix, as well as single action and double action airbrushes. It explains airbrush paint, paint feed systems and air sources. This video demonstrates in detail, through training exercises, how to conduct airbrush maintenance and troubleshooting. It is the most comprehensive airbrush video on the market.<br> <EOL>Authors: Ryan Scott Weber and John Weber.<br> <EOL><br> <EOL>*VIDEO-1 VL airbrush video (VCR)<br> <EOL>Shipping weight: 12 oz. (340 g.) <EOL>",,10000,4,Y,0.010,N,,1,0,0,0,10,Y,376,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Books and Videos,,6.800,,Friday 25 May 2007 05:12:54 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614126868,5,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
