38951,PAA-VL-100D,bhavesh2,Paasche VL-100D Airbrush Intermediate Package,Paasche VL-100D Airbrush Intermediate Package,14,329,0,,"<b>The ‘VL’ is our most versatile double action airbrush. It is perfect for T-shirts, Taxidermy and most other <EOL>applications. The D500SR delivers clean dry air at 20-30 P.S.I.</b><br> <EOL>VL-1000D Components:<br> <EOL>* D500SR Air Compressor 1/8HP, ETL Listed with Switch & R-75 Reg.<br> <EOL>* AC-7 Airbrush Cleaning Kit with 7 cleaning brushes<br> <EOL>* VL#3 Double Action Siphon Feed Airbrush- Internal Mix<br> <EOL>* A-1/8-6 6' Air Hose w/ Couplings<br> <EOL>* VL-1/4-OZ Metal Color Cup (1/4oz/7cc)<br> <EOL>* VL-1-OZ Color Bottle Assembly (1oz/29cc)<br> <EOL>* H-194 Bottle, Cap/Gasket (1oz./29cc)<br> <EOL>* VL-189 Head Protecting Cap<br> <EOL>* VLT-1 & 5 Tips<br> <EOL>* VLN-1 & 5 Needles<br> <EOL>* VLA-1 & 5 Aircaps<br> <EOL>* A-34 Airbrush Hanger<br> <EOL>* V-62 Wrench<br> <EOL>* TTALB ""22 Airbrush Lessons"" Booklet<br> <EOL>* Parts List",,9986,15,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,10,Y,363,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Single Action: External Mix,,182.350,,Monday 08 February 2010 10:43:12 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614145883,148.050,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
