141338,PAA-VSR-2W,agapito,Paasche VSR Double Action Gravity Feed Airbrush in Wood Case,Paasche VSR Double Action Gravity Feed Airbrush in Wood Case ,1.900,136,0,,"<span style=""font-weight: bold;"">Features:</span><br /> <EOL> <EOL>The VSR model is a gravity feed detail airbrush with removable cup.  The <EOL> VSR includes both available heads and can achieve detail down to 1/64  <EOL>inch and up to 1 inch.  A PTFE packing enables the VSR to handle any  <EOL>water or solvent based paint.  <br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL>Clean up is as simple as spraying your  <EOL>paint cleaner though the airbrush and wiping of the needle.  The VSR can <EOL> be used for many applications including hobby, automotive,  <EOL>illustration, graphics, nails etc.  <br /> <EOL><br /> <EOL>The VSR airbrush is made in the US  <EOL>and includes the following:  <br /> <EOL> <EOL><ul> <EOL>	<li>VSR#1 airbrush</li> <EOL>	<li>size 2 spray head</li> <EOL>	<li>3/16oz  <EOL>metal cup</li> <EOL>	<li>hanger, wrench</li> <EOL>	<li>6' braided hose</li> <EOL>	<li>lessons booklet and manual.</li> <EOL></ul>",,0,0,N,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,10,Y,367,Uncategorized/Paasche Airbrush/Double Action: Internal Mix/VSR & VJR Series: Gravity Feed,,70.180,,Tuesday 17 July 2012 10:44:28 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,10,026614097625,54.400,0,N,7,Paasche Airbrush Co.
